MODULE: PinConvergesCheckpointOnce
TARGET: PinConverges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the maintainer checkpoints only its first batch, so the cursor pin never follows the head
PERTURBS: Checkpoint

--- FIND
    /\ ~deleted /\ rb = "idle" /\ applied > ckpt
    /\ ckpt' = applied
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~deleted /\ rb = "idle" /\ applied > ckpt /\ ckpt = 0
    /\ ckpt' = applied
--- END
